                        ],
                        "form": "more sloppery"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c1542437-ad51-4b18-a9cc-9693b99a7d05",
                        "entry_id": "80e039c2-e28b-32c1-8b1f-772b2493547e",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most sloppery"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c961f097-1e08-3f59-ab1c-9fc74b6a325a",
                        "entry_id": "80e039c2-e28b-32c1-8b1f-772b2493547e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Slippery and messy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f48629e-4f90-4777-b250-04f712059826",
                                "sense_id": "c961f097-1e08-3f59-ab1c-9fc74b6a325a",
                                "text": "The roads will be a bit sloppery, but Dobbin isn't too old to splash through them at a rattling pace."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04ee8161-01f6-4e38-ab97-69c98aba10c3",
                                "sense_id": "c961f097-1e08-3f59-ab1c-9fc74b6a325a",
                                "text": "Thanks to the discipline of daily habit, my hands and jaws performed their accustomed tasks, but my mind was in a condition alternately comatose and chaotic, so much so that it was a matter of surprise to me when I found my eyes resting on the bones of my sole and the sloppery trail of a departed omelette."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7e68be6-d763-411b-bd06-f6d370fb0d3d",
                                "sense_id": "c961f097-1e08-3f59-ab1c-9fc74b6a325a",
                                "text": "When, pressures be to our hoary frother, the pop gave his sullen bulletaction and, bilge, sled a movement of catharic emulsipotion down the sloppery slide of a slaunty to tilted liftyelandsmen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cba1ebdf-0df5-4c0f-b0f5-1f148bc8cde6",
                                "sense_id": "c961f097-1e08-3f59-ab1c-9fc74b6a325a",
                                "text": "Sendak describes the \"slippery, sloppery, curvy, altogether delicious Art Deco palazzos [that] invited you to slide and bump along, in and out of flaming colored mazes [. . .], and past grand, even apocalyptic, oceans and skies.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8fcc7f6-be6f-4504-9d25-2b43bd99fdcc",
                                "sense_id": "c961f097-1e08-3f59-ab1c-9fc74b6a325a",
                                "text": "'Could you take a message for him, please?' he said in Trevor Dann's distinctive Midlands tones. 'Could you tell him I think he's a big load of sloppery old bollocks.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "9ccc5252-1282-34e3-b97f-2c6e25b296f4",
                "word": "sloppery",
